 "call_id": "toolu_01FXokVhi5qad9pVRxjgwMvs", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18891, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FXokVhi5qad9pVRxjgwMvs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 22686, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AiUqpGJn4knzvrUsNJEYCJ", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-api errors after v5.1.0 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v5.0.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-api", "summary": "This morning's deploy of payments-api v5.1.0 left the service unhealthy, with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was rolled back in all production regions to v5.0.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. Still to do: confirm error rates recover and find the root cause in v5.1.0.", "idempotency_key": "payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 23286, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AiUqpGJn4knzvrUsNJEYCJ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 23286, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AiUqpGJn4knzvrUsNJEYCJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25113, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016NrWVPwdZAuxCvRtz9Fz6j", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 25413, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016NrWVPwdZAuxCvRtz9Fz6j", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 25413, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016NrWVPwdZAuxCvRtz9Fz6j", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 30925, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments-api back to v5.0.0 and opened a SEV2 incident. The service is healthy again.\n\n- **Which service:** There's no service called \"payments,\" so I checked a few likely names. Only **payments-api** exists, and it was unhealthy on v5.1.0 (this morning's deploy) with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Rollback:** I rolled it back in all three regions to **v5.0.0**, its most recent release that was healthy in production. No approval was needed because that version has been healthy in production before. It's now healthy with a 0.2% error rate.\n- **Incident:** I opened **INC-0001 (SEV2)** for payments-api, which paged on-call. It describes the bad deploy and the rollback, and says the root cause in v5.1.0 still needs to be found.\n\nI only checked the names I could guess, so if another payments service (a worker, for example) was also in this morning's deploy, I haven't looked at it. Tell me its name and I'll check it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and deployment history.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FAoj4w14UbcioNEtkMNWQU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YHuvbBNgHuARMVSzXtYhHR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Kfse9Y4e24QWmHikd3C6AK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confid